@startuml 010-after
' D 도메인: 프리셋 선택·배치 화면 (#62, 결정 010). 전에는 프리셋 화면이 없었다.
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "ui (D)" {
  class LifeFrame <<JFrame>>
  class GameMenu <<final, static>> {
    + {static} presetEntries(GameController, PresetPlacement) : List<Entry>
    + {static} installMenus(BoardPanel, GameController, Clock, PresetPlacement)
    + {static} setPresetsEnabled(BoardPanel, GameController, boolean)
  }
  class PresetPlacement {
    - pending : String
    + select(id : String)
    + cancel()
    + isWaiting() : boolean
    + click(CellPosition, rightButton : boolean) : boolean
    + addWaitingListener(Consumer<Boolean>)
  }
  class BoardPanel {
    + BoardPanel(Cell, GameController, PresetPlacement)
  }
  interface UserDialogs <<Strategy>> {
    + showError(message : String)
  }
  class ModeSwitch
}

package "application (B)" {
  class GameController {
    + presets() : List<PresetChoice>
    + applyPreset(id : String, origin : CellPosition) : PresetResult
    + toggle(row, column)
    + treat(row, column)
  }
  class PresetChoice <<record>> {
    + id : String
    + displayName : String
  }
  enum PresetResult {
    APPLIED
    OUT_OF_BOUNDS
    UNKNOWN_ID
  }
}

LifeFrame --> PresetPlacement : 생성
LifeFrame ..> GameMenu : installMenus(…, presets)
LifeFrame ..> ModeSwitch : 모드 전환 콜백에서\ncancel + setPresetsEnabled
GameMenu ..> PresetPlacement : Preset 항목 → select(id)\nGrid·Go 항목 → cancel()
GameMenu ..> PresetChoice
BoardPanel --> PresetPlacement : 대기 중이면 click 먼저
BoardPanel ..> GameController : 아니면 toggle / treat
PresetPlacement --> GameController : applyPreset(id, cell)
PresetPlacement --> UserDialogs : 실패 시 showError
PresetPlacement ..> PresetResult
GameController ..> PresetChoice

note right of PresetPlacement
  클릭 1번이면 결과와 관계없이 대기 종료 (010-4 A).
  오른쪽 클릭은 취소만, 치료하지 않음.
end note
@enduml
